@startuml
!include _skin.iuml
autonumber "<b>0."
actor "Teknisi\nInstalasi" as T
participant "Perangkat IoT\n(Secure Element\nATECC608)" as D
participant "Aplikasi\nProvisioning" as APP
participant "Device Registry\nService" as REG
participant "Certificate Authority\nService (CAS)" as CAS
database "Cloud SQL\n(device)" as DB
participant "EMQX Broker" as B
== Tahap pabrik (manufaktur) ==
D -> D : bangkitkan key pair ECC P-256\ndi secure element (private key tidak pernah keluar)
D -> CAS : CSR dengan ID pabrik
CAS --> D : sertifikat "birth" (Manufacturer CA,\nberlaku 10 thn)
== Tahap instalasi lapangan ==
T -> APP : pindai QR (serial_no)\n+ ambil GPS & foto
APP -> REG : POST /devices/claim\n{serial, lokasi, zona, asset_id}
REG -> DB : cek serial ada di allowlist\npengadaan (BAST)
REG -> DB : INSERT device status=PENDING
REG --> APP : 201 Created
== Tahap aktivasi (zero-touch) ==
D -> B : CONNECT ke endpoint provisioning\n(mTLS dengan sertifikat birth)
B -> REG : webhook auth: fingerprint birth cert
REG --> B : izinkan topik $prov/{serial} saja
D -> B : PUBLISH CSR operasional (key pair baru)
B -> REG : teruskan CSR
REG -> CAS : terbitkan sertifikat operasional\n(Subordinate CA "scms-devices", 1 thn)
CAS --> REG : sertifikat X.509 (CN=device_id)
REG -> DB : UPDATE status=ACTIVE,\ncert_fingerprint, cert_expires_at
REG -> B : publish konfigurasi + sertifikat\nke $prov/{serial}
B --> D : sertifikat operasional + device_id
D -> B : DISCONNECT lalu CONNECT ulang\n(mTLS sertifikat operasional)
B -> B : ACL: hanya scms/+/{zone}/{device_id}/#
D -> B : PUBLISH telemetri pertama
note over REG, CAS
Rotasi otomatis 30 hari sebelum kedaluwarsa.
Pencabutan: CRL/OCSP CAS + blokir di ACL broker.
end note
@enduml
